{
  "page": 313,
  "lang": "ar",
  "edition": "quran-uthmani",
  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 2361,
      "text": "I have chosen you, so listen to what is being revealed:",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 313,
      "ruku": 270,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2362,
      "text": "‘Indeed, I am Allah; none has the right to be worshiped except Me, so worship Me and establish prayer to remember Me.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 313,
      "ruku": 270,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2363,
      "text": "The Hour is certainly coming, but I almost keep it hidden[4], so that every soul will be recompensed for what it strives.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 313,
      "ruku": 270,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2364,
      "text": "So do not let those who disbelieve in it and follow their desires distract you from it[5], or you will perish.’”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 313,
      "ruku": 270,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2365,
      "text": "What is that in your right hand, O Moses?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 313,
      "ruku": 270,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2366,
      "text": "He said, “It is my staff. I lean on it and beat down leaves with it for my sheep, and I have other uses for it.”[6]",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 313,
      "ruku": 270,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2367,
      "text": "Allah said, “Throw it down, O Moses!”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 313,
      "ruku": 270,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2368,
      "text": "He threw it down, and it suddenly became a slithering snake.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 20,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 313,
      "ruku": 270,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2369,
      "text": "Allah said, “Pick it up and have no fear. We will restore it to its former state.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 21,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 313,
      "ruku": 270,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2370,
      "text": "Put your hand under your armpit; it will come out shining white without blemish, as another sign[7],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 22,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 313,
      "ruku": 270,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2371,
      "text": "so that We may show you some of Our greatest signs.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 23,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 313,
      "ruku": 270,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2372,
      "text": "Go to Pharaoh, for he has transgressed all bounds.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 24,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 313,
      "ruku": 270,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2373,
      "text": "He said, “My Lord, reassure my heart for me,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 25,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 313,
      "ruku": 271,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2374,
      "text": "and ease my task for me,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 26,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 313,
      "ruku": 271,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2375,
      "text": "and loosen the knot from my tongue[8],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 27,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 313,
      "ruku": 271,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2376,
      "text": "so that they may understand my speech.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 28,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 313,
      "ruku": 271,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2377,
      "text": "And appoint for me a helper from my family,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 29,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 313,
      "ruku": 271,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2378,
      "text": "Aaron, my brother.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 30,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 313,
      "ruku": 271,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2379,
      "text": "Increase my strength through him,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 31,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 313,
      "ruku": 271,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2380,
      "text": "and let him share my task,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 32,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 313,
      "ruku": 271,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2381,
      "text": "so that we may glorify You much,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 33,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 313,
      "ruku": 271,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2382,
      "text": "and remember You much.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 34,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 313,
      "ruku": 271,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2383,
      "text": "For indeed You are All-Watchful over us.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 35,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 313,
      "ruku": 271,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2384,
      "text": "Allah said, “You are granted your request, O Moses.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 36,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 313,
      "ruku": 271,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2385,
      "text": "And We had already conferred favor upon you before,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 37,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 313,
      "ruku": 271,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    }
  ],
